{
  "openapi": "3.0.3",
  "info": {"title":"UCRP — Unified Retail Customer Platform for Shopping Centers","version":"1.0.0","description":"REST API specification for the shopping center unified guest profile platform (case #2). Source of truth for paths and methods — `endpoint-registry.md` (90 endpoints); for data structure — `05-er-data-model.md` (E-1…E-21).\n\nConventions:\n* Base prefix — `/api/v1`; `/healthz` is outside the prefix.\n* Format — JSON, UTF-8; time in UTC (RFC 3339); money — integer minor units (`amountMinor`, 35000 = 350.00 RUB).\n* JSON field names — `camelCase`; query parameter names keep the registry notation (`snake_case`).\n* Authentication — `Authorization: Bearer <JWT access>` (TTL 15 min), refresh — httpOnly cookie. Role and `tenantId` come from the token claims.\n* Roles: `R-1` Management company marketer, `R-2` Manager, `R-3` Tenant, `R-4` Analyst, `R-6` System (does not use REST). `R-5` Guest has no access.\n* R-3 isolation: `tenantId` comes only from the claims; a mismatch with the path/request → 403 `forbidden_tenant`; the repository always applies `WHERE tenant_id = :claimTenant`.\n* Unified error format: `{\"error\":{\"code\",\"message\",\"details\":[{\"field\",\"reason\"}],\"request_id\"}}`.\n* Check order: 401 (authentication) → 403 (role) → 400 (validation) → 403 (foreign tenant) → 404 → 409.\n* Timeout budget: request 30 s, segment preview 10 s, synchronous export 25 s, connector external HTTP 30 s; exceeding → 504 `timeout`.\n* The `x-roles` and `x-uc` extensions link an operation to the role registry and use cases.","contact":{"name":"UCRP API Team"},"license":{"name":"Proprietary","url":"https://ucrp.local/license"}},
  "servers": [{"url":"/","description":"Current host"}],
  "tags": [{"name":"Auth","description":"Authentication and the current user (UC-16)"},{"name":"Users","description":"Platform user management (UC-18)"},{"name":"Reference","description":"Reference data: tenants, categories, projects, event types, source types and instances (UC-17)"},{"name":"Imports","description":"File uploads, statuses, rejected rows, manual sync (UC-1, UC-14)"},{"name":"Guests","description":"Unified guest profile, event feed, contacts, recommendations (UC-2, UC-4)"},{"name":"Identity","description":"Disputed merge queue, profile merge and split, merge blocks (UC-11, UC-12)"},{"name":"Segments","description":"No-code segment builder, rule versions, membership, recompute (UC-3, UC-13)"},{"name":"Campaigns","description":"Campaigns and effect measurement (UC-20)"},{"name":"Exports","description":"Segment export to a channel, control group, contact limits (UC-5, UC-10)"},{"name":"Analytics","description":"Manager dashboards, tenant aggregates, data quality (UC-7, UC-8, UC-9)"},{"name":"Audit","description":"Audit log (UC-19)"},{"name":"System","description":"Service endpoints"}],
